      ],
      "known_limitations": [
        "touch_limit_count uses high == the day's limit price; an intraday touch that leaves no trace in the daily high is missed.",
        "leader_damage carries only the close-to-preclose move; the intraday maximum drawdown needs minute bars and stays null on the daily-bar backfill path.",
        "coverage_ratio is recorded per record and days below coverage.minimum_ratio are stamped coverage_status=partial rather than dropped; consumers must not read a partial day as a full-universe count.",
        "Metrics are shadow research inputs carrying calibrated=false semantics; they have never been validated against realised returns."
      ]
